MovieMagic UML Detailed Explanation:
Movie Theater
  •	Purpose: Represents a physical cinema facility. 
  •	Key Attributes: int Id, String Name, Address Address. 
  •	Relationships:
    o	1-to-1 with Address: Holds a single Address object containing street, city, state, and zip code details. 
    o	1-to-Many with Auditorium: Contains a collection (List<Auditorium>) representing the screens/rooms within the facility. 
Auditorium
  •	Purpose: Represents an individual screening room or auditorium within a theater. 
  •	Key Attributes: int Id, String Name, int MovieTheaterId. 
  •	Relationships:
    o	Many-to-1 with Movie Theater: Linked via int MovieTheaterId. 
    o	1-to-Many with Seat: Owns the physical seat layout (List<Seat>). 
    o	1-to-Many with ShowTime: Hosts screenings over time (List<ShowTime>). 
Seat
  •	Purpose: Represents a physical chair inside an auditorium. 
  •	Key Attributes: int Id, string Row, int SeatNumber, enum SeatType, int AuditoriumId. 
  •	Relationships:
    o	Many-to-1 with Auditorium: Linked via int AuditoriumId. 
    o	1-to-Many with ShowtimeSeat: Replicated into runtime showtime instances so that you can reserve seats for the same auditorium as long as it’s a different showtime. 
Movie
  •	Purpose: Represents a film in the catalog. 
  •	Key Attributes: int Id, string Name, string Rating, string Genre, Time MovieLength. 
  •	Relationships:
    o	1-to-Many with ShowTime: A single movie can have multiple scheduled showtimes. 
ShowTime
  •	Purpose: A specific scheduled screening of a movie in a specific auditorium. 
  •	Key Attributes: int Id, DateTime Showtime, Double TicketPrice, Movie Movie, int AudtiroiumId. 
  •	Relationships:
    o	Many-to-1 with Movie: Points to the movie entity. 
    o	Many-to-1 with Auditorium: Linked via int AudtiroiumId. 
    o	1-to-Many with ShowtimeSeat: Generates individual availability records for every seat during this showtime. 

ShowtimeSeat
  •	Purpose: Represents the reservation state of a specific physical seat during a specific showtime. 
  •	Key Attributes: int Id, ShowTime Showtime, int SeatId, bool IsReserved. 
  •	Relationships:
    o	Many-to-1 with ShowTime: References the associated screening. 
    o	Many-to-1 with Seat: Points to the physical venue chair via int SeatId. 
    o	1-to-Many with Cart Item: Can be referenced temporarily by an active shopping cart item. 
    o	1-to-1 with Ticket: Points to the final issued ticket upon purchase completion. 
Shopping Cart
  •	Purpose: Holds temporary selections for active guest or logged-in user sessions. 
  •	Key Attributes: int Id, int SessionId, List<Cart Item>, DateTime Created, DateTime LastUpdated. 
  •	Relationships:
    o	1-to-Many with Cart Item: Contains a collection of selected tickets (List<Cart Item>). 
Cart Item
  •	Purpose: Represents an individual item added to the shopping cart prior to purchase. 
  •	Key Attributes: int Id, ShowTimeSeatId, double Price, int CartId. 
  •	Relationships:
    o	Many-to-1 with Shopping Cart: Linked back to its parent cart via int CartId. 
    o	Many-to-1 with ShowtimeSeat: Points to the target ShowtimeSeat instance being held. 
Customer
  •	Purpose: Represents the buyer/user placing an order. 
  •	Key Attributes: int Id, string Email, string PhoneNumber. 
  •	Relationships:
    o	1-to-Many with Order: Can place multiple orders over time. 
Order
  •	Purpose: Represents a completed financial transaction and purchase record. 
  •	Key Attributes: int Id, string OrderNumber, int CustomerId, DateTime OrderDate, Double Total, List<Ticket>. 
  •	Relationships:
    o	Many-to-1 with Customer: Linked via int CustomerId. 
    o	1-to-Many with Ticket: Contains the list of purchased ticket artifacts (List<Ticket>). 
Ticket
  •	Purpose: Represents the finalized proof-of-purchase artifact sent to the customer (e.g., via email). 
  •	Key Attributes: int Id, ShowTimeSeatId, double PricePaid, string QrCode, int OrderId. 
  •	Relationships:
    o	Many-to-1 with Order: Linked to its parent transaction via int OrderId. 
    o	Many-to-1 with ShowtimeSeat: References the specific reserved screening seat. 

